POST {{baseUrl}}/product-components
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parent_product_id": "{{lavarropasId}}",
  "child_product_id": "{{panelId}}",
  "child_variant_id": "{{panelVariantId}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### Componente: carcasa x1
POST {{baseUrl}}/product-components
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parent_product_id": "{{lavarropasId}}",
  "child_product_id": "{{carcasaId}}",
  "child_variant_id": "{{carcasaVariantId}}",
  "quantity": 1,
